      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i dont know if im just being cautious or if this is real. it feels pretty scary when everything goes black for a sec. i really dont wanna have to make an appointment and wait weeks just to talk to a doctor because i know theyll just tell me it's fine or tell me to take more of it anyway. is there anything else i can do at home to fix the blood pressure so i dont have to keep dealing with this dizziness?",
